# Byte-exact spans are the lexer's currency (spec/01 [gram.lex.source]):
# sources must check out byte-identical on every platform. LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
# Every PR adds its entry at the top of `## Unreleased`, so two open PRs
# always conflict there. Union keeps both sides' new lines, trunk's first,
# with no markers. Its failure: two edits of the same existing line keep
# both lines. Read the merged entry when two PRs touch one.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
